WEBVTT

00:00:04.563 --> 00:00:07.043
One fateful day,
the pigs encountered--[ Snorting ]

00:00:07.087 --> 00:00:11.483
a big, bad wolf--[ Snarling ]

00:00:11.526 --> 00:00:14.268
who had a wonderful
surprise for them.

00:00:14.312 --> 00:00:19.012
The wolf offered the three
piggies and all their friends
a job working for her.

00:00:19.055 --> 00:00:22.798
Everyone would be so happy.

00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:24.322
All the three little piggies
had to do...

00:00:24.365 --> 00:00:26.454
was just steal one
little crown...

00:00:26.498 --> 00:00:28.195
that the beautiful wolf
had wanted...

00:00:28.239 --> 00:00:32.112
ever since she was
a penniless, little street cub,

00:00:32.156 --> 00:00:36.029
unloved and abandoned.[ Whimpers ]

00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:39.337
But that crown would mean
she was a princess,

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.774
and everybody loves a princess!

00:00:41.817 --> 00:00:44.080
So the wolf sent the piggies
to get that crown.

00:00:44.124 --> 00:00:46.344
[ Snorting ][ Alarm Wails ]

00:00:46.387 --> 00:00:48.868
But the little pigs weren't up
to the challenge.

00:00:48.911 --> 00:00:51.000
They failed their mission.

00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:56.528
So the wolf huffed and puffed
and she blew them off
the face of the earth!

00:00:58.312 --> 00:00:59.748
Yo, po-po!

00:01:03.404 --> 00:01:04.927
The end.

00:01:05.928 --> 00:01:09.018
[ Minions Shuddering ]

00:01:09.062 --> 00:01:12.196
Good luck getting
that crown tomorrow,
little piggies.

00:01:13.632 --> 00:01:16.287
[ Whispering ]
I know you won't disappoint me.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:18.767
[ Stuttering ]Hmm.

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:23.207
[ Snoring ]

00:01:28.299 --> 00:01:30.388
[ Brakes Screech ]

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.087
Okay.
[ Minionese ]

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:35.784
[ Whimpering ]

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.438
Oh, which way is
the loo, please?Hmm?

00:01:37.482 --> 00:01:41.007
Oh, thank you.[ Minionese ]

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:42.617
[ Clears Throat ]
Bello.

00:01:42.661 --> 00:01:44.445
Uh, three, please.

00:01:44.489 --> 00:01:47.492
You're not allowed in
without an adult.

00:01:47.535 --> 00:01:49.233
Scram, hooligans!

00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:52.018
Oh--
[ Growls, Minionese ]

00:01:52.061 --> 00:01:53.628
Uh, hmm.

00:01:53.672 --> 00:01:57.197
[ Chuckling ]

00:01:57.241 --> 00:01:59.068
Eh--
[ Minionese ]

00:01:59.112 --> 00:02:00.679
[ Minionese ][ Gasps ]
Oh, la--

00:02:00.722 --> 00:02:02.289
[ Blows Raspberry, Minionese ]

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.160
[ Stuart Grunts ][ Screaming ]

00:02:06.815 --> 00:02:08.513
How many tickets, please?

00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:11.080
Uh-- Three, please.

00:02:11.124 --> 00:02:12.517
[ Mumbling ]

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.259
Uno,please. Uno.[ Nervous Chuckle ]

00:02:20.394 --> 00:02:22.091
Enjoy yourself, love.

00:02:22.135 --> 00:02:23.615
Thank you!Thank you!

00:02:25.486 --> 00:02:28.402
[ Laughing ]
It was nowhere near Hyde Park!

00:02:28.446 --> 00:02:30.491
Bob's your uncle.

00:02:30.535 --> 00:02:33.102
Ah.
[ Minionese ]

00:02:33.146 --> 00:02:35.061
Okay.

00:02:35.104 --> 00:02:36.802
[ Grunts, Gasps ]

00:02:36.845 --> 00:02:38.586
♪♪ [ Humming ]

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.327
[ Minionese ]

00:02:40.371 --> 00:02:42.677
[ Kevin Clears Throat ]
Okay.
[ Minionese ]

00:02:42.721 --> 00:02:44.244
Oh![ Kevin Grunting ]

00:02:44.288 --> 00:02:45.593
[ Minionese ]

00:02:45.637 --> 00:02:47.900
[ Sighs ]

00:02:47.943 --> 00:02:50.294
Okay.
[ Minionese ][ Man ] Hey!

00:02:50.337 --> 00:02:52.339
What are you doing here?

00:02:52.383 --> 00:02:54.167
[ Stammering, Minionese ]

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:57.736
This is a restricted area!
Hands in the air!

00:02:57.779 --> 00:03:00.260
Uh, no--
[ Stuttering ][ Minionese ]

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.873
♪♪ [ "Hair" In Minionese ]

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:06.266
Stop that!

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:09.225
♪♪ [ Continues ]

00:03:09.269 --> 00:03:11.010
Get back.

00:03:14.927 --> 00:03:19.323
♪♪ [ Minionese ]

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:31.160
[ Laughing ]

00:03:31.204 --> 00:03:32.771
Yay!

00:03:32.814 --> 00:03:34.642
♪♪ [ Continues ]

00:03:46.437 --> 00:03:48.395
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:03:48.439 --> 00:03:50.397
Bob, Stuart--
[ Minionese ]

00:03:51.485 --> 00:03:53.095
[ Giggling ]

00:03:53.139 --> 00:03:55.446
[ Cheering ]

00:03:57.839 --> 00:04:00.799
[ Panting ]

00:04:00.842 --> 00:04:02.757
[ Whimpering ]

00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:09.329
[ Groans ][ Minionese ]

00:04:09.373 --> 00:04:10.374
[ Chuckles ]

00:04:21.515 --> 00:04:23.952
[ Minionese ]

00:04:26.825 --> 00:04:29.741
[ Minionese, Chuckles ][ Man ]So...

00:04:29.784 --> 00:04:34.049
you came for the queen's
crown, did you?

00:04:34.093 --> 00:04:37.096
Well, you're gonna have
to get through me!

00:04:37.139 --> 00:04:39.577
The Keeper of the Crown!

00:04:40.839 --> 00:04:43.711
[ Sputters, Laughing ]

00:04:43.755 --> 00:04:45.974
[ Mocks In Minionese ]
Hey!

00:04:46.018 --> 00:04:49.021
You think it's funny
to mock the elderly,
do you?

00:04:49.064 --> 00:04:51.066
Uh, sí?Ooh!

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:54.418
I've been up here for decades,
just waiting for someone...

00:04:54.461 --> 00:04:57.333
to try and steal
the queen's treasure!

00:04:57.377 --> 00:04:58.944
[ Groans ]

00:04:58.987 --> 00:05:00.598
Okay.
[ Minionese ]

00:05:00.641 --> 00:05:02.556
♪♪ [ Minionese ]

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.558
What are you saying?
Never mind, don't care!

00:05:06.168 --> 00:05:07.735
[ Laughs ]

00:05:09.302 --> 00:05:10.825
Oh, no!
[ Minionese ]

00:05:10.869 --> 00:05:13.393
Oh, no, you don't!

00:05:13.437 --> 00:05:14.960
[ Screaming ]

00:05:15.003 --> 00:05:16.352
Oh, flippin' heck!

00:05:17.571 --> 00:05:20.226
Ow!
[ Groans ]
What's going--

00:05:20.269 --> 00:05:22.663
[ Minionese ]

00:05:22.707 --> 00:05:26.014
[ Shouting In Minionese ]

00:05:26.058 --> 00:05:27.538
Bob--
[ Minionese ]

00:05:27.581 --> 00:05:29.975
Eh-- Hmm.
Wow.

00:05:32.717 --> 00:05:34.109
[ Straining ][ Minionese ]

